{
  "slug": "engram",
  "name": "Engram",
  "type": "plugin",
  "description": "Persistent memory for AI agents. Give Claude real memory that survives across sessions -- semantic recall, automatic consolidation, knowledge graphs, and bi-temporal tracking. 92% on DMR benchmark, 80% on LOCOMO.",
  "longDescription": "Ships **4 skills**, **4 commands** and **1 MCP server**.\n\n- **Skills** (4): `memory-brief` (Get a session briefing with relevant context, top entities, and any alerts), `memory-consolidate` (Run memory consolidation to distill episodic memories into semantic knowledge), `memory-recall` (Recall relevant memories before answering questions about past work, decisions, preferences, people, or project context), `memory-remember` (Store important information in persistent memory)\n- **Commands** (4): `brief`, `recall`, `remember`, `stats`\n- **MCP servers** (1): `engram`\n\nInstalls with `claude plugin install engram@claude-community` from `tstockham96/engram-plugin`.",
  "compatibility": [
    "claude"
  ],
  "pluginType": "package",
  "package": {
    "skill": 4,
    "command": 4,
    "mcp": 1
  },
